I’ll inspect the specimen metadata, diffraction range/resolution, and the frozen analysis tooling first. Then I’ll identify coherent peak families, build a replayable GSAS-II multiphase checkpoint, refine only physically supported parameters, and export every deliverable from the submitted project.

